  "notes": "Unapproved Inventory visual candidate (UI-INV-001..006 and the Inventory behaviour required by FR-INV). The earlier note that an approved Inventory source existed in Claude Design is historical and does not approve the bytes registered here. The source cites no FR-INV, BR-INV or UI-INV identifier on any screen; requirement coverage is established by the integration traceability in provenance.json, not by the design. No stock-ledger rule, costing, permission, API or decision is invented; unresolved items stay OPEN. The package ships the real support.js (byte-identical to the accepted copies) and doc-page.js for the six print variants. It is NOT an approved visual reference; owner visual approval has not been given."
